        "Content": "Nestled in the beautiful Kildare countryside, yet conveniently located just 2 miles from Kildare Town, this stunning home offers a wonderful blend of rural tranquility, generous outdoor space and excellent accessibility.\r\n\r\nSet on a mature and beautifully maintained site, the property enjoys a particularly attractive outlook over the surrounding countryside, with sweeping views across the adjoining farmland towards the distant landscape.\r\n\r\nThe property is approached via a tarmacadam driveway with steel entrance gates, providing excellent parking and access to the detached garage. Mature hedging, established trees and carefully maintained gardens create a wonderfully private and peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nInternally, the house offers well-proportioned and comfortable accommodation, including three bedrooms, a spacious kitchen, living room, utility room, ensuite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nOne of the property's most appealing features is its exceptional outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nThe mature gardens provide an abundance of lawn, established planting, trees and hedging, creating a peaceful and private environment around the home.\r\n\r\nTo the rear and side, the property enjoys an enviable open outlook across the surrounding fields and countryside, making this an ideal home for those looking to enjoy a quieter rural lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nThe detached garage, electric roller door, extensive driveway and EV charging point add further practicality, while the patio provides an additional space to enjoy the garden during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys the best of both worlds  a beautiful rural setting surrounded by open countryside, while being just approximately 2 km from Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nKildare Town provides a wide range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and services, while its excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin and other major towns and cities.\r\n\r\nThe location makes this an appealing choice for those seeking a peaceful country home without sacrificing convenience.\r\n\r\nBeautifully positioned, exceptionally private and surrounded by the Kildare countryside, this charming home offers a rare opportunity to enjoy rural living just minutes from Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, gardens, accommodation and wonderful countryside views.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nOne of the property's most appealing features is its exceptional outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nThe mature gardens provide an abundance of lawn, established planting, trees and hedging, creating a peaceful and private environment around the home.\r\n\r\nTo the rear and side, the property enjoys an enviable open outlook across the surrounding fields and countryside, making this an ideal home for those looking to enjoy a quieter rural lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nThe detached garage, electric roller door, extensive driveway and EV charging point add further practicality, while the patio provides an additional space to enjoy the garden during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys the best of both worlds  a beautiful rural setting surrounded by open countryside, while being just approximately 2 km from Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nKildare Town provides a wide range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and services, while its excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin and other major towns and cities.\r\n\r\nThe location makes this an appealing choice for those seeking a peaceful country home without sacrificing convenience.\r\n\r\nBeautifully positioned, exceptionally private and surrounded by the Kildare countryside, this charming home offers a rare opportunity to enjoy rural living just minutes from Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, gardens, accommodation and wo